{"schema_version": 2, "unit_id": "tag:01LQ:prose-0001", "parent_tag": "01LQ", "chapter": "constructions", "node_kind": "paragraph", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe place ourselves in Situation <REF_0001>, i.e.,\n<MATH_0001> is a scheme and <MATH_0002> is a quasi-coherent sheaf of\n<MATH_0003>-algebras.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nFor any <MATH_0004> the pullback\n<MATH_0005> is a quasi-coherent sheaf of <MATH_0006>-algebras.\nWe are going to consider pairs <MATH_0007> where\n<MATH_0008> is a morphism of schemes and <MATH_0009>\nis a morphism of <MATH_0010>-algebras. Note that this is the\nsame as giving a <MATH_0011>-algebra homomorphism\n<MATH_0012>, see\nSheaves, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nThis is also the same as giving an <MATH_0013>-algebra map\n<MATH_0014>, see\nSheaves, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nWe will use all three ways of thinking about <MATH_0015>,\nwithout further mention.\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\nGiven such a\npair <MATH_0016> and a morphism <MATH_0017> we get\na second pair <MATH_0018> which we\ncall the pullback of <MATH_0019>. One way to describe\n<MATH_0020> is as the composition\n<MATH_0021>\nwhere the second map is <MATH_0022> with\n<MATH_0023>.\nIn this way we have defined a functor\n<MATHSEG_0001>pairs <MATHSEG_0002> as above<MATHSEG_0003>\n\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "REF_0001": "\\ref{situation-relative-spec}", "MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_S$", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent", "MATH_0004": "$f : T \\to S$", "MATH_0005": "$f^*\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}_T$", "MATH_0007": "$(f : T \\to S, \\varphi)$", "MATH_0008": "$f$", "MATH_0009": "$\\varphi : f^*\\mathcal{A} \\to \\mathcal{O}_T$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{O}_T$", "MATH_0011": "$f^{-1}\\mathcal{O}_S$", "MATH_0012": "$\\varphi : f^{-1}\\mathcal{A} \\to \\mathcal{O}_T$", "REF_0002": "\\ref{sheaves-lemma-adjointness-tensor-restrict}", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{O}_S$", "MATH_0014": "$\\varphi : \\mathcal{A} \\to f_*\\mathcal{O}_T$", "REF_0003": "\\ref{sheaves-lemma-adjoint-push-pull-modules}", "MATH_0015": "$\\varphi$", "STRUCT_0004": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0005": "\\noindent", "MATH_0016": "$(f : T \\to S, \\varphi)$", "MATH_0017": "$a : T' \\to T$", "MATH_0018": "$(f' = f \\circ a, \\varphi' = a^*\\varphi)$", "MATH_0019": "$(f, \\varphi)$", "MATH_0020": "$\\varphi' = a^*\\varphi$", "MATH_0021": "$\\mathcal{A} \\to f_*\\mathcal{O}_T \\to f'_*\\mathcal{O}_{T'}$", "MATH_0022": "$f_*a^\\sharp$", "MATH_0023": "$a^\\sharp : \\mathcal{O}_T \\to a_*\\mathcal{O}_{T'}$", "MATHSEG_0001": "\\begin{eqnarray}\n\\label{equation-spec}\nF : \\Sch^{opp} & \\longrightarrow & \\textit{Sets} \\\\\nT & \\longmapsto & F(T) = \\{\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}(f, \\varphi) \\text{", "MATHSEG_0003": "}\\}\n\\nonumber\n\\end{eqnarray}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "math_text_regions": [{"region_id": "math/0001", "delimiter_kind": "environment", "source": "\\begin{eqnarray}\n\\label{equation-spec}\nF : \\Sch^{opp} & \\longrightarrow & \\textit{Sets} \\\\\nT & \\longmapsto & F(T) = \\{\\text{pairs }(f, \\varphi) \\text{ as above}\\}\n\\nonumber\n\\end{eqnarray}", "source_hash": "sha256:df9a4cf218712a8d2090a20e2cc1388f79d60e31708f732d262a245ecb27ec12", "source_byte_span": {"start": 1394, "end": 1581}, "pieces": [{"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0001"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0002"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0002"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0003"}], "slots": [{"slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001", "source": "pairs ", "command": "text", "policy_entry": "p0-frame-constructions-10", "slot_byte_span": {"start": 124, "end": 130}, "boundary_placeholders": ["MATHSEG_0001", "MATHSEG_0002"], "classification_witness": {"usage": "p0-locked-math-frame", "usag